资料固定，不应当在申报时临时决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归类改变触发重算\">归类改变触发重算</h3><p>商品编码变化（产品改型、归类重新判定）会使法定计量单位可能变化，进而是所有历史映射失效。因此 <code>customs_uom_mapping</code> 必须按 <code>hs_code</code> 分行存储并带生效期，编码变更时新增行、关闭旧行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见错误\">常见错误</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>用销售单位申报</strong>：把&quot;磅&quot;填进法定单位栏，即使数量换算正确也会被退单。</li>\n<li><strong>把包装层级当计量单位</strong>：申报&quot;3 箱&quot;，而该编码要求的是千克；箱数是包装事实，不是计量事实（见 <a href=\"../pack-hierarchy/each-inner-case-pallet-hierarchy\">each/inner/case/pallet 包装层级</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>法定第二单位缺失填报</strong>：部分编码强制要求第二单位，漏填会被退回。</li>\n<li><strong>映射硬编码在申报服务里</strong>：编码表修订时需要改代码而不是改数据。</li>\n<li><strong>不同目的国共用一套映射</strong>：同一个六位编码在不同国家的法定单位可能不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"映射的解析与缓存\">映射的解析与缓存</h2><h3 id=\"一条解析函数\">一条解析函数</h3><p>申报时每次都要解析映射，因此它应当是纯函数且可缓存。缓存键必须包含商品编码与目的国，并随编码表版本失效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def resolve_statutory_uom(sku, dest, hs_code, as_of):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;返回 (uom_1, qty_1, uom_2, qty_2) 或抛出阻断异常。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    m = mapping_repo.get(sku, dest, hs_code, as_of)&#10;    if m is None:&#10;        raise DeclarationBlocked(&#10;            f&quot;no statutory uom mapping for {sku}/{dest}/{hs_code}&quot;)&#10;    q_base = inventory.base_qty(sku, as_of)          # 基准单位数量&#10;&#10;    if m.conversion_basis == &quot;DIRECT&quot;:&#10;        q1 = convert(q_base, m.base_uom, m.statutory_uom_1)&#10;    elif m.conversion_basis == &quot;PER_UNIT_CONTENT&quot;:&#10;        units = count_units(sku, as_of)              # 计数单位数量&#10;        q1 = convert(units * m.coverage, m.coverage_uom, m.statutory_uom_1)&#10;    else:&#10;        q1 = None&#10;        raise DeclarationBlocked(&quot;PER_UNIT_AREA not configured with geometry&quot;)&#10;&#10;    q1 = round_to_authority_precision(q1, dest, m.statutory_uom_1)&#10;    q2 = (round_to_authority_precision(count_units(sku, as_of), dest,&#10;                                       m.statutory_uom_2)&#10;          if m.statutory_uom_2 else None)&#10;    return m.statutory_uom_1, q1, m.statutory_uom_2, q2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve_statutory_uom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sku, dest, hs_code, as_of):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"返回 (uom_1, qty_1, uom_2, qty_2) 或抛出阻断异常。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mapping_repo.get(sku, dest, hs_code, as_of)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DeclarationBlocked(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no statutory uom mapping for </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hs_code</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    q_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory.base_qty(sku, as_of)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基准单位数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.conversion_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DIRECT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        q1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> convert(q_base, m.base_uom, m.statutory_uom_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.conversion_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"PER_UNIT_CONTENT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_units(sku, as_of)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 计数单位数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        q1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> convert(units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.coverage, m.coverage_uom, m.statutory_uom_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        q1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DeclarationBlocked(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PER_UNIT_AREA not configured with geometry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    q1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> round_to_authority_precision(q1, dest, m.statutory_uom_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    q2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (round_to_authority_precision(count_units(sku, as_of), dest,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                       m.statutory_uom_2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.statutory_uom_2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.statutory_uom_1, q1, m.statutory_uom_2, q2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>函数在映射缺失或面积类参数未配置时<strong>抛异常</strong>，而不是回退到任意默认值——这保证不会有编造的数字进入报关单。</p>\n<h3 id=\"映射健康度巡检\">映射健康度巡检</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT m.sku_id, m.destination, m.hs_code, m.conversion_basis,&#10;       COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE i.sku_id IS NULL) AS inventory_rows&#10;FROM customs_uom_mapping m&#10;LEFT JOIN inventory_balance i&#10;  ON i.sku_id = m.sku_id AND i.qty_base &gt; 0&#10;WHERE m.valid_to IS NULL&#10;GROUP BY 1,2,3,4&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE i.sku_id IS NULL) = 0&#10;   AND SUM(i.qty_base) IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hs_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">conversion_basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_rows</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customs_uom_mapping m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_balance i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询找的是<strong>有映射但从未有过库存</strong>的记录，通常意味着映射配置的方向反了（配给了一个不存在的 SKU），或者该 SKU 已停售而映射未关闭。它是映射表卫生的日常巡检项之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>法定计量单位由<strong>国家编码表</strong>规定，而非由 HS 六位编码规定；映射键必须包含目的国与本国编码。</li>\n<li>报关单上三个数量栏位语义不同：法定第一（强制）、法定第二（该编码有则必填）、成交单位（商业事实）；三者都应由基准单位派生。</li>\n<li>跨族映射需借助商品级参数（每单位净含量、面积），参数缺失时必须硬失败而非回退默认值。</li>\n<li>映射表带编码依据与生效期，编码修订时新增记录而非原地修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换算链拉长后取整带来的误差与残差，见下一篇 <a href=\"uom-rounding-residual-control\">单位换算四舍五入与残差控制</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"报关/法定检验计量单位映射（联040/075）","id":"报关-法定检验计量单位映射-联040-075"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"法定计量单位的权威来源","id":"法定计量单位的权威来源"},{"level":3,"text":"商品编码决定单位","id":"商品编码决定单位"},{"level":3,"text":"三个栏位的语义","id":"三个栏位的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"映射链的构造","id":"映射链的构造"},{"level":3,"text":"从基准单位到法定单位","id":"从基准单位到法定单位"},{"level":3,"text":"商品级换算参数","id":"商品级换算参数"},{"level":2,"text":"检验检疫单位的特殊性","id":"检验检疫单位的特殊性"},{"level":3,"text":"法检商品的额外要求","id":"法检商品的额外要求"},{"level":3,"text":"计数单位的歧义","id":"计数单位的歧义"},{"level":2,"text":"申报数量的一致性约束","id":"申报数量的一致性约束"},{"level":3,"text":"三个数字必须自洽","id":"三个数字必须自洽"},{"level":3,"text":"归类改变触发重算","id":"归类改变触发重算"},{"level":2,"text":"常见错误","id":"常见错误"},{"level":2,"text":"映射的解析与缓存","id":"映射的解析与缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"一条解析函数","id":"一条解析函数"},{"level":3,"text":"映射健康度巡检","id":"映射健康度巡检"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基准单位库存与多单位库存（联034）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/base-unit-inventory-multiuom"},"next":{"title":"单位换算四舍五入与残差控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-customs-rounding/uom-rounding-residual-control"}}